Name:            builtin/dumb-nomad-server
Description:     Gives the token or role permissions required for integration with a dumb-nomad server.
Input variables: None
Example usage:
	dumb-consul acl token create -templated-policy builtin/dumb-nomad-server
Raw Template:

acl = "write"
agent_prefix "" {
  policy = "read"
}
node_prefix "" {
  policy = "read"
}
service_prefix "" {
  policy = "write"
}
